data: {"id": "0e25ae1418d34daf-thinking-parallel_evidence-675", "run_id": "0e25ae1418d34daf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已执行的观测性 baseline 结果，Pod `workload` 处于 `ContainerCreating` (Pending) 阶段，容器未启动，因此日志和流量均为空是预期结果。下一步需要通过 Kubernetes 原生工具确认具体的挂载/调度卡点。\n\n执行计划：\n1. **kubectl_get_yaml**: 获取 Pod 完整 YAML，检查 volumes 和 volumeMounts 配置。\n2. **kubectl_events**: 获取 Pod 事件，重点查找 `FailedMount` 或 `FailedCreate` 等报错。\n3. **kubectl_describe**: 查看 Pod 详细状态和挂载信息。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789129501425, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

