data: {"id": "0e25ae1418d34daf-thinking-parallel_evidence-1099", "run_id": "0e25ae1418d34daf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 采集事实与结论\n\n**实体身份与生命周期**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v06/workload` (UID: `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`)\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **状态**: `Pending` / `ContainerCreating`\n- **容器**: `app` (未启动，重启次数 0)\n\n**异常根因证据 (VolumeMountFailed)**\n- **直接原因**: `FailedMount` 事件明确显示：`hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory`。\n- **配置核对**: Pod YAML 确认定义了一个名为 `input` 的 `hostPath` Volume，路径指向 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input`。\n- **状态持续**: 事件在 46 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789129508081, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

